howcasing the latest version of the game.Apprentice of Darkness is a hand-drawn, dark-fantasy turn-based roguelike where you don’t save the world, you assemble a party of monsters, fight the forces of good, capture your enemies, and sacrifice them to strengthen your Tower of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T19:33:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033982","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:00:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1845383656397437","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"Combat Is Getting Clearer and Hits Are Getting Heavier","summary":"Hello, dark apprentices!I’ve been working on making combat easier to read and more satisfying to watch. From choosing your next victim to seeing the consequences of a spell, I want every action to communicate more clearly.Know what your next spell will doHover over a valid target with a skill selected to see a preview showing:The target’s name and current/max health.Expected damage against that specific enemy.Status effects and their durations.Damage-over-time totals, listed separately.The previ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T19:29:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397437","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1845383656390572","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"Sacrifice Mini-Games Reworked","summary":"Sacrifice Mini-Games ReworkedGreetings, Apprentices!I have been working on a major gameplay update for the three sacrifice mini-games featured in the Apprentice of Darkness demo.My goal was to make every sacrifice more challenging, responsive, and rewarding while giving each ritual its own identity. The mechanics, presentation, feedback, and reward systems have all received significant improvements.A New Performance SystemAll three sacrifice mini-games now include a dedicated performance system.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T05:55:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390572","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1844115010498430","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"How I Draw & Paint the Characters of Apprentice of Darkness","summary":"Ever wondered how the characters in Apprentice of Darkness are made?Every character in the game is drawn and painted by hand, and I recorded several days of the process while creating some of them.I sped everything up and condensed roughly 3 days of drawing and painting into just 3 minutes, from the first sketches to the finished characters.Check out the full process below! There are still plenty of characters left to create, so back to drawing for me! _theRaven Solo Developer of Apprentice of D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T06:58:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498430","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1843481262702579","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"The Apprentice of Darkness Demo Is OUT NOW!","summary":"The wait is over.The Apprentice of Darkness demo is officially available now on Steam!And the timing couldn't be better, Apprentice of Darkness is also participating in Steam's Party-Based RPG Fest, running September 14–21.If you've been waiting to step onto the wrong side of the battlefield, now's your chance.Download the demo and play for free today!Play the Bad GuysIn Apprentice of Darkness, you're not here to save the world.You're here to conquer it.Build a party of monsters, battle the forc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T17:41:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702579","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1842212951310207","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"Apprentice of Darkness Demo Launches September 14","summary":"The wait is almost over!I'm excited to announce that the Apprentice of Darkness demo will officially launch on September 14, alongside Steam's Party-Based RPG Fest.And to celebrate the announcement, I've also released a brand-new gameplay trailer showing the latest version of the game:In Apprentice of Darkness, you're not here to save the world.You're here to conquer it.Build a party of monsters, battle the forces of good in grid-based turn-based combat, capture your enemies, and sacrifice them ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T13:27:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310207","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1836506165546225","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"The Playtest Ends June 30... But Something Better Is Coming","summary":"Greetings, Apprentices!The Apprentice of Darkness Playtest will officially conclude on June 30, 2026.Over the past month, hundreds of battles have been fought, countless captives have been sacrificed, and a tremendous amount of valuable feedback has been collected. Thanks to your participation, I've gathered the data and insights needed to continue improving the game and preparing it for the next stage of development.Because of this, the current Playtest build will be taken offline at the end of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T14:56:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165546225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1833968530891646","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"The Public Playtest Is Now Live!","summary":"The gates of darkness are finally open.After years of development, testing, balancing, bug fixing, and countless late evenings spent working on this project alongside my full-time job, I'm excited (and a little nervous) to finally welcome players into the world of Apprentice of Darkness.The Public Playtest is now live on Steam.As a solo developer, this playtest is one of the most important stages of development so far. No matter how much testing I do myself, nothing compares to seeing real playe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T16:20:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530891646","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1833968530887156","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"Public Playtest Sign-Ups and Launch Time","summary":"After a long period of development, testing, balancing, bug fixing, and probably sacrificing my own sanity to the Tower of Darkness...I’m finally preparing to open the Public Playtest of Apprentice of Darkness.The playtest build is planned to go live on:May 29 — 12:00 PM EDT (Eastern Time)If everything goes according to plan (and no demons escape containment), everyone who requested access through Steam will be able to download the game and begin their descent into darkness.As a solo developer w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T05:23:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530887156","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1833334318566173","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"The Gates of Darkness Are Opening Soon","summary":"Hello, my name is _theRaven and I am the solo indie developer behind the game \"Apprentice of Darkness\",The closed beta phase of Apprentice of Darkness has begun, and the ritual is almost ready for a wider audience.Very soon, the Public Playtest will open on Steam, allowing more players to enter the world of darkness, command forbidden powers, sacrifice enemies, recruit sinister allies, and help shape the future of the game before the public demo.Apprentice of Darkness is a dark fantasy turn-base","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-20T12:37:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318566173","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1832065502823739","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Beta Sign-Ups Are Now Open","summary":"The gates of darkness are opening soon.I am preparing a small closed beta test for Apprentice of Darkness, and I am looking for players who would like to help shape the game before the public demo release.The beta will focus on:Gameplay feedbackBalance testingBug reportsGeneral impressions & atmosphereIf you enjoy dark fantasy, turn-based strategy, roguelikes, or simply want to help improve the game during development, you can now sign up for a chance to participate.🩸 Closed Beta Sign-UpHere is ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-12T12:38:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502823739","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1832065502809386","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Gameplay Trailer Released and Demo Coming Soon!","summary":"Hello everyone,After a long time of development, I’m excited to finally share the first official gameplay trailer for Apprentice of Darkness upcoming demo! Check it out from below!Apprentice of Darkness is a dark fantasy turn-based tactics game where you play as the “evil” side — commanding dark forces, fighting against humans and fantasy creatures, sacrificing enemies, and expanding the power of your Tower of Darkness.The new trailer showcases: ⚔️ Turn-based tactical combat 🔥 Powerful magic abi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-06T15:50:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502809386","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1806698490772480","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"How to make a Dark Ritual Game?","summary":"I love talking about games in general, so I thought why am I not sharing my vision with others? Obviously, I don't expect to get millions of views, but as I've said talking about games, design, art etc. I love this stuff, so as a hobby I've decided to use my Youtube channel a bit more actively. If you love these sort of stuff, check out this video below and give me your thoughts!Also a little update, there will be a \"Beta\" testing soon for my game, so stay tuned for that. I am almost there!See y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-03T07:49:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806698490772480","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1803527891795462","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"Apprentice of Darkness Demo is Almost Ready!","summary":"Hey there Servant of Darkness! I am _theRaven, solo developer of the game called \"Apprentice of Darkness\" and today I have some news to share with you!First of all, I would like to announce that a demo is on it's way and I have also completed most of my checklist before the demo, get done with the core mechanics and the visuals that I need for the game, but I've also made some crucial decisions and changes to the game design. I am a solo developer who works in a full time job, so the progress is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-05T08:46:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1803527891795462","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3621350-1795917897495660","game_id":"steam-3621350","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome Apprentice of Darkness!","summary":"Welcome Apprentice of Darkness! This is my evil little passion project. It’s a turn-based strategy game where you don’t save the world—you corrupt it. You lead hellish armies across a continent, spreading darkness, capturing enemies, and sacrificing them (sometimes dramatically) to power up your Tower of Darkness. Also, the weather changes every few levels. Not because it affects gameplay much, just because I thought it would look cool. Priorities. There’s dark humor, terrible decisions, and a l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-08T19:41:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795